1
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:21,517
For this to work, what you need is
the power of my stand, the world.

2
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,497
Beyond the powers my stand
shall bestow upon you lies the

3
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,992
