will of God before the law of humans.

9
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:54,800
The question remains, will I ever cross
paths with someone like this one day?

10
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,090
Additionally,

11
00:00:57,173 --> 00:01:01,371
you need the souls of more than 36
humans who have committed atrocious sins.

12
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:06,460
That is because those who have
sinned harbor a strong power within.

13
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,500
Of equal note, there are 14
words you need to keep in mind.

14
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:14,420
Their significance is vital to this plan,

15
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:19,740
so I will engrave them onto my stand to
ensure that I never forget them myself.

16
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:23,477
What is most necessary is courage.

17
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:28,700
I'm loath to do so, but I must have the
courage to relinquish my stand once.

18
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:31,385
As it gradually disintegrates,

19
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:35,380
my stand will take form and absorb
the souls of the 36 sinners,

20
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:38,440
and will give birth to
something entirely new.

21
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,720
Whatever is born will awaken.

22
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:47,293
And once these 14 words are
uttered by my trusted friend,

23
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,852
the newborn will express a keen interest.

24
00:01:55,700 --> 00:02:00,620
In this moment, my friend will trust
me as I befriend this new entity.

25
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,506
Lastly, you will need
an appropriate location.

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,100
North latitude, 28 degrees, 24 minutes.

27
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:11,560
West longitude, 80 degrees, 36 minutes.

28
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:20,700
Go there, and wait patiently
for the next new moon.

29
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,840
That, my friend, is when heaven will come.

30
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,300
